PREAMBLE & PURPOSE

This repository makes the source code of AAMARVA publicly visible for technical transparency, architectural review, non-commercial evaluation, independent security research, bug reporting, and controlled community contributions.

Public visibility of this source code does NOT grant general open-source permissions or unrestricted rights to use, deploy, host, redistribute, sublicense, or commercialize the Software. All rights not expressly granted under this License are reserved by AAMARVA.

